{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"These are "},{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"core"}]},{"type":"text","value":" options and API properties for all columns. More options and API properties are available for other "},{"type":"link","href":"../../guide/features.md","children":[{"type":"text","value":"table features"}]},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"column-api","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Column API"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"All column objects have the following properties:"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"id","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"id"}]},{"type":"code","value":"id: string","lang":"tsx"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The resolved unique identifier for the column resolved in this priority:"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"A manual "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"id"},{"type":"text","value":" property from the column def"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The accessor key from the column def"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The header string from the column def"}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"depth","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"depth"}]},{"type":"code","value":"depth: number","lang":"tsx"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The depth of the column (if grouped) relative to the root column def array."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"accessorfn","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"accessorFn"}]},{"type":"code","value":"accessorFn?: AccessorFn<TData>","lang":"tsx"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The resolved accessor function to use when extracting the value for the column from each row. Will only be defined if the column def has a valid accessor key or function defined."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"columndef","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"columnDef"}]},{"type":"code","value":"columnDef: ColumnDef<TData>","lang":"tsx"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The original column def used to create the column."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"columns","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"columns"}]},{"type":"code","value":"type columns = ColumnDef<TData>[]","lang":"tsx"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The child column (if the column is a group column). Will be an empty array if the column is not a group column."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"parent","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"parent"}]},{"type":"code","value":"parent?: Column<TData>","lang":"tsx"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The parent column for this column. Will be undefined if this is a root column."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"getflatcolumns","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"getFlatColumns"}]},{"type":"code","value":"type getFlatColumns = () => Column<TData>[]","lang":"tsx"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns the flattened array of this column and all child/grand-child columns for this column."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"getleafcolumns","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"getLeafColumns"}]},{"type":"code","value":"type getLeafColumns = () => Column<TData>[]","lang":"tsx"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns an array of all leaf-node columns for this column. If a column has no children, it is considered the only leaf-node column."}]}],"headings":[{"id":"column-api","text":"Column API","level":2},{"id":"id","text":"id","level":3},{"id":"depth","text":"depth","level":3},{"id":"accessorfn","text":"accessorFn","level":3},{"id":"columndef","text":"columnDef","level":3},{"id":"columns","text":"columns","level":3},{"id":"parent","text":"parent","level":3},{"id":"getflatcolumns","text":"getFlatColumns","level":3},{"id":"getleafcolumns","text":"getLeafColumns","level":3}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\nThese are **core** options and API properties for all columns. More options and API properties are available for other [table features](../../guide/features.md).\n\n## Column API\n\nAll column objects have the following properties:\n\n### `id`\n\n```tsx\nid: string\n```\n\nThe resolved unique identifier for the column resolved in this priority:\n\n- A manual `id` property from the column def\n- The accessor key from the column def\n- The header string from the column def\n\n### `depth`\n\n```tsx\ndepth: number\n```\n\nThe depth of the column (if grouped) relative to the root column def array.\n\n### `accessorFn`\n\n```tsx\naccessorFn?: AccessorFn<TData>\n```\n\nThe resolved accessor function to use when extracting the value for the column from each row. Will only be defined if the column def has a valid accessor key or function defined.\n\n### `columnDef`\n\n```tsx\ncolumnDef: ColumnDef<TData>\n```\n\nThe original column def used to create the column.\n\n### `columns`\n\n```tsx\ntype columns = ColumnDef<TData>[]\n```\n\nThe child column (if the column is a group column). Will be an empty array if the column is not a group column.\n\n### `parent`\n\n```tsx\nparent?: Column<TData>\n```\n\nThe parent column for this column. Will be undefined if this is a root column.\n\n### `getFlatColumns`\n\n```tsx\ntype getFlatColumns = () => Column<TData>[]\n```\n\nReturns the flattened array of this column and all child/grand-child columns for this column.\n\n### `getLeafColumns`\n\n```tsx\ntype getLeafColumns = () => Column<TData>[]\n```\n\nReturns an array of all leaf-node columns for this column. If a column has no children, it is considered the only leaf-node column.\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\ntitle: Column APIs\n---\n\nThese are **core** options and API properties for all columns. More options and API properties are available for other [table features](../../guide/features.md).\n\n## Column API\n\nAll column objects have the following properties:\n\n### `id`\n\n```tsx\nid: string\n```\n\nThe resolved unique identifier for the column resolved in this priority:\n\n- A manual `id` property from the column def\n- The accessor key from the column def\n- The header string from the column def\n\n### `depth`\n\n```tsx\ndepth: number\n```\n\nThe depth of the column (if grouped) relative to the root column def array.\n\n### `accessorFn`\n\n```tsx\naccessorFn?: AccessorFn<TData>\n```\n\nThe resolved accessor function to use when extracting the value for the column from each row. Will only be defined if the column def has a valid accessor key or function defined.\n\n### `columnDef`\n\n```tsx\ncolumnDef: ColumnDef<TData>\n```\n\nThe original column def used to create the column.\n\n### `columns`\n\n```tsx\ntype columns = ColumnDef<TData>[]\n```\n\nThe child column (if the column is a group column). Will be an empty array if the column is not a group column.\n\n### `parent`\n\n```tsx\nparent?: Column<TData>\n```\n\nThe parent column for this column. Will be undefined if this is a root column.\n\n### `getFlatColumns`\n\n```tsx\ntype getFlatColumns = () => Column<TData>[]\n```\n\nReturns the flattened array of this column and all child/grand-child columns for this column.\n\n### `getLeafColumns`\n\n```tsx\ntype getLeafColumns = () => Column<TData>[]\n```\n\nReturns an array of all leaf-node columns for this column. If a column has no children, it is considered the only leaf-node column.\n"}
